{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"agent_message","text":"The full sandbox backend flow passed: a real Stripe test PaymentIntent for $22.50 succeeded, the deployed signed webhook accepted it, Scalable Press generated a design and order-ready quote, and Stripe metadata was updated to `fulfillment=quoted` / `mode=quote`. No live funds or physical fulfillment were used. I’ve also added security headers, accessibility focus states, stable hydration, a manifest/favicon, and pinned Vercel to Node 22; I’m doing the final deployed smoke check now."}}
